      "updated": 1786117260000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "f9",
      "text": "• Mounted tablet works in landscape and portrait\n\n• Done / N/A / Claim / Handoff / Addressed are large targets\n\n• Labels + outlines carry state; color is supplemental\n\n• No hover dependency, tiny checkbox, swipe precision, drag target, or hidden accordion\n\n• Sticky progress/lifecycle action remains reachable while scrolling\n\n• Persistent risk messages survive gaze-away and dirty-hand pauses",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Mounted tablet works in landscape and portrait\n\n• Done / N/A / Claim / Handoff / Addressed are large targets\n\n• Labels + outlines carry state; color is supplemental\n\n• No hover dependency, tiny checkbox, swipe precision, drag target, or hidden accordion\n\n• Sticky progress/lifecycle action remains reachable while scrolling\n\n• Persistent risk messages survive gaze-away and dirty-hand pauses",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
